Figures 3.13 (SSP 2-4.5) and 3.14 (SSP 5-8.5) show the 25th percentile extraction

Results and discussion
46
rates, indicative of areas with lower thermal conductivity or minimal urban heat input. 
For SSP 2-4.5, extraction rates vary from approximately 24 W/m in northern and 
eastern Germany to around 43 W/m in more thermally favorable southwestern regions 
under sustainable scenarios. 
